Besides the petitioners are also entitled to the following reliefs:
a) they shall be entitled to solatium at the rate of 30% per anum on he enhanced market value off the land assessed hereinabove;
b) they shall also be entitled to additional compensation @ 12% per annum under section 23 (1A) of the Act w.e.f. the date of issuance of noificaion under section 4 of the Act i.e. 1.12.2005 till the date of award made by Land Acquisition Collector i.e.
1.2.2007;
c) they shall be entitled to interest under section 23 of the Act on market value assessed under section 23 (1) of the Act, the additional compensation worked out under section 23 (1A) of the Act besides solatium awarded under section 23 (2) of the Act at the rate of 9% per annum from 1.12.2005 for a period of one year and thereafter at the rate of 15% per annum till the date of payment/deposit of the compensation as assessed .
above."
